        "description": "Dataset contains polygons of significant aquifers (glacial deposits that are a significant ground water resource) for Maine mapped at a scale 1:24,000, from the Maine Geological Survey. Printed maps published by the Maine Geological Survey on USGS 7.5' quadrangle bases. Aquifer boundaries delineated and digitized by the Maine Geological Survey from data compiled on USGS 7.5' quadrangle bases. Aquifer polygons coded by yield expected from a properly constructed well (using the AQUIFERTYPE field or the field ATYPE = 0 area not mapped as aquifer; ATYPE = 1 10-50 gallons-per-minute; ATYPE = 2 greater than 50 gallons-per-minute; ATYPE = 3 island of non-aquifer material within an area mapped as aquifer).",
